    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/3549d7b9462414d405ef6c36b3aa99be.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Man vs. Machine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelite. Horde Survival. Squad-Builder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/2691c236f6d7cfd723a7360a8adc6993.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/2691c236f6d7cfd723a7360a8adc6993.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/2691c236f6d7cfd723a7360a8adc6993.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world threatened by evil M.E.G.A. Corp.\u2019s private robot army, the last bastion of hope for mankind is a bunch of armed lunatics who signed up for a mercenary job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who's better to lead them than a disposable clone with an unpredictable set of special traits? Welcome to your new assignment, Commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the battle to the enemy and build your underfunded, over-ambitious outfit into an apocalyptic war machine that rids the world of evil billionaire overlords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With all chances stacked against your rebellious operation, this isn\u2019t about glory. This is about the loot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/89d307f03613920f2cbe5805954662cc.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div>Every Commander clone is created from a set of randomly selected traits. Can you lead your squad to victory with a hawk-eyed, sly Infiltrator? Or take on the enemy alone with a nocturnal, greedy One-Man Army? How about a brilliant, vampiric Ninja?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each combination of traits yields a unique run with its own set of challenges, mechanics, and surprising synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your favorite weapon and unleash the havoc! But first, you need a squad:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/481ec387176633af315ea92123e10efc.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/481ec387176633af315ea92123e10efc.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/481ec387176633af315ea92123e10efc.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/5df728d28fcb9c27393ae14b67bd9da0.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div>Assemble your team of mercenaries from a roster of vigorous fighters. Each Merc totes their own arsenal and tactics to tackle the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit the right Mercs into your squad for each operation, supercharge their combat effectiveness by specializing in complex skill trees, and leverage their synergies with hi-tech Gear to build a game-breaking, horde-slaying killer squad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/df6de3e5783db96915c1f178fccdf1d1.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/df6de3e5783db96915c1f178fccdf1d1.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/df6de3e5783db96915c1f178fccdf1d1.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/8d548fbedecc8b6c14d38f5aa36256d6.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div>Navigate a variety of procedurally generated maps in each operation. Capture objectives to call in reinforcements or sack valuable loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strike hard and fast! The clock is ticking. Each minute wasted on the battlefield is punished with more and stronger enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/346610e20fa458c5b30dcac574411ea9.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/346610e20fa458c5b30dcac574411ea9.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/346610e20fa458c5b30dcac574411ea9.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/c02973bc83a5b7247d3fbf1351f2be36.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div>Call in your extraction point and defend it to make it out alive! Or survive long enough to face dangerous bosses and their underlings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware: it's all or nothing! Die and lose your loot. Or survive and take home your spoils of war to come back even stronger!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/a9f1326a47d76cc4fd0bd94003a5e394.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/a9f1326a47d76cc4fd0bd94003a5e394.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/a9f1326a47d76cc4fd0bd94003a5e394.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/db1dd0dc60693720a5094cc60d25d96e.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div>Invest your loot to hire new Mercs, purchase new Gear, expand your bunker HQ for powerful upgrades, or research new traits &amp; weapons for your Commander clones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/d8dc5c82a9a476af56902dbe665c70a6.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/d8dc5c82a9a476af56902dbe665c70a6.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/d8dc5c82a9a476af56902dbe665c70a6.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/017df25e673b28c4c2a555b71f95c3c7.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div>Direct your squad with tactical abilities or fight actively in the battle \u2013 each Commander clone and loadout offers a completely different play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment and find your optimal squad build for any challenge the procedural maps may offer. No two runs will ever be the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/17361be9d8a2d142b2789b651401a348.poster.avif?t=1754611913\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/17361be9d8a2d142b2789b651401a348.webm?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/17361be9d8a2d142b2789b651401a348.mp4?t=1754611913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141520/extras/ea0133a9607a8d0ce2ebfb3d855483be.avif?t=1754611913\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control a Commander clone, generated from 3 random Traits, with over 15,000 unique combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your squad with actively controlled weapons and many different active &amp; passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your squad from a large variety of Mercs with unique skill trees &amp; specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from dozens of Gear items to modify and improve your squad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conduct your Operations on distinct, procedural Maps with different mission parameters, difficulty, and unique Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your Bunker HQ in between Operations with the loot you\u2019ve scavenged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full support for controllers and keyboard/mouse input</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stream the game with Twitch integration and let your audience decide your fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on SteamDeck, full compatibility verified</p></li></ul>",
